<p>dashte balaa me gum ali akbar ki laash hai<br />
farzand-e faatima ko pisar ki talaash hai<br />
daagh-e jigar ko naaqoon-e gham ki kharaash hai<br />
sang-e alam se sheesha-e dil paash paash hai</p>

<p>banu ko ghash hai ahle-haram dard mand hai<br />
hai hai pisar ki ghar me sadaaye'n buland hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillaate hai ke baap ke pyaare khidhar gaye<br />
aye noor-e chashm aankho'n ke taare kidhar gaye<br />
aye meri zindagi ke sahaare kidhar gaye<br />
pahooncha ke mujhko gor kinare kidhar gaye</p>

<p>andher hai agar na tumhen paayega pidar<br />
aawaaz doge tum to chalaa aayega pidar<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>roothe ho kis liye ali akbar jawaab do<br />
sadqe ho baap aye mere dilbar jawaab do<br />
aye mere hum shabihe payambar jawaab do<br />
tum se bichad ke zeest ho kyu'nkar jawaab do</p>

<p>jo raah hai tumhaari wohi apni raah hai<br />
laazim hai rahem baap ki haalat tabaah hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kis jaa pe tum pade ho bataao pidar nisaar<br />
aawaaz hum ko apni sunaao pidar nisaar<br />
hum gir pade hai aa ke uthaao pidar nisaar<br />
chaati se phir pidar ko lagaao pidar nisaar</p>

<p>ruksat hai apne ghar ko zaraa dekh bhaal lo<br />
laghzish hai haath paoo'n me akbar sambhaal lo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kis se mai puchoo'n kaun tumhaara pataa bataaye<br />
ye bekas-o ghareeb musaafir kidhar ko jaaye<br />
qismat me meri thokre'n likkhi hai haaye haaye<br />
is zindagi se kaash khuda humko bhi uthaaye</p>

<p>andher hai ke god ke paalo'n se chutt gaye<br />
manzil pa aake qafile waalo'n se chutt gaye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ab haath bhi pakadd ke uthaata nahi'n koi<br />
rone pa mere rahem bhi khaata nahi'n koi<br />
yousuf ki meri shakl dikhaata nahi'n koi<br />
beta tumhaari laash bataata nahi'n koi</p>

<p>haalat hamaari kaahe ko dekhi hai aap ne<br />
tum ko khayaal hogaa khabar li na baap ne<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aye fouj-e zulm baano ke dilbar ko kya kiya<br />
bekas ko tashnakaam ko bepar ko kya kiya<br />
aye zaalimo shabihe payambar ko kya kiya<br />
miltaa nahi'n mere ali akbar ko kya kiya</p>

<p>lillah do pata ke bhatakte hai raah me<br />
shaayad giraa diya mere yousuf ko chaah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillati hai ke god ka paala kahaa'n gaya<br />
aankho'n ka noor ghar ka ujaalaa kahaa'n gaya<br />
chashm-o chiraagh-e syed-e waalaa kahaa'n gaya<br />
meraa woh lambe gesuo'n waalaa kahaa'n gaya</p>

<p>do bete kho ke paayaa tha is naunehaal ko<br />
barchi se kisne qatl kiya mere laal ko<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>